      "title": "SSO Integration Module in Staging (LATAM) experiencing timeouts and rate limits",
      "description": "We are seeing significant instability with the SSO Integration Module in our LATAM staging environment. Starting around 10:00 AM local time, we began receiving 'rate limit exceeded' errors. In addition to these 429s, some requests return a malformed JSON response which breaks our client-side parsing, and others are simply timing out after 30 seconds. Currently, about 46 users in the test group are blocked from logging in. This is moderating our release schedule as we cannot validate the SSO flow."
